## Appendix C EA-DSQN: Full Implementation Details

This section expands Algorithm 1 from the Main Text, providing the complete implementation-level procedure required for exact reproducibility. The key additions relative to the main-text version are: (i) the 3-head action decoding over independent output sub-populations; (ii) explicit Q-value readout via membrane-potential accumulation; (iii) per-head Bellman targets; (iv) the sparsity regularization loss applied to the two hidden LIF layers; and (v) gradient clipping via clip\_grad\_value\_(100) rather than norm clipping.

